@startuml process_view

skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant Dashboard
participant "Flask API" as API
participant VMManager
participant VirtualMachine as VM

User -> Dashboard : Click Start
Dashboard -> API : POST request
API -> API : Identify session
API -> VMManager : start_vm(vm_id, session_id)
VMManager -> VM : Set status to running
VMManager --> API : Success
API --> Dashboard : JSON response
Dashboard -> API : Refresh data
API --> Dashboard : Updated VM data
Dashboard --> User : Display status

@enduml